    "text": "By Indra Deshmukh ,\n1 days ago I’m a woman in STEM, but I was almost an English major. With the weather warming up and finals almost out of the way, my mind is itching again to write creatively and read voraciously. In particular, I crave spaces that invite anybody to appreciate literature and storytelling, regardless of their academic experience. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
